msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"Hey, hey! No weapons, asshole! Did I not just fuckin'\r\n"
"tell you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Come back when you have some actual technique.\r\n"
"I generally don't move from this spot, so... yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"Man, that was like watching a bear trying to hit a mosquito.\r\n"
"That buff guy fumbled all over himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Guess whatever he had in power, he lacked in speed.\r\n"
"I mean, even you couldn't do it, dude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "*pant* *pant*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Boy, did you get soft over the years... soft as a goddamn\r\n"
"cupcake! The man I used to know was tougher than fossilized\r\n"
"beef jerky! Or, y'know, maybe I just got too good at this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Perhaps I'm giving you too much credit here, but I consider\r\n"
"you my rival."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"And your performance today just didn't cut the mustard.\r\n"
"So, what can I say, other than work on your swing and come\r\n"
"back some other time. I'll be waiting, same place as usual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "So, you're back. Can't say I didn't see that coming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"Price is still 3,000 yen per challenge. Punch or kick me\r\n"
"once within a single minute or less and win 50 grand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Think you can take me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "(50,000 yen for just one hit? Not a bad deal...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "All right. I'll take you on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear! It'll cost you 3,000 yen\r\n"
"up front. That okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Fine by me... Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"All right! Now remember, you gotta hit me once within\r\n"
"a minute to get yourself a piece of that sweet money pie.\r\n"
"And by money pie, I mean 50,000 yen. We discussed this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"And weapons are off limits⑬gotta keep it clean. Now then...\r\n"
"If you think you can keep the pace... then try and bust my face!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "...Ah. Looks like I'm a little short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"Hey, I'm trying to run a business here! No cash, no contest!\r\n"
"*sigh* Let's take it from the top..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Go scrounge yourself up some cash and come back later.\r\n"
"I got this spot staked out, so... I'll be waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "All right. Then I'll be back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "Sorry... Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Wait, what? You chickening out all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"This ain't no goddamn silent film, buddy. Go scrape up some\r\n"
"cash⑬I dunno, beat up some thugs or something⑬and come\r\n"
"back when you're feeling like a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"Well, well... Look who came crawling back. You up for the challenge now, or "
"what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"Rules are still the same: 3,000 yen up front. Punch or kick\r\n"
"me once in under a minute and the 50,000 yen is yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Wanna give it a shot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "(50,000 yen for just one hit? Not a bad deal...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "All right. I'll take you on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear! Now fork over 3,000 yen.\r\n"
"Gotta pay to play, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Fine by me... Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid ""
"All right! Now. To reiterate. Hit me within a minute, and\r\n"
"that 50,000 yen's as good as yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid ""
"And weapons are off limits⑬gotta keep it clean. Now then...\r\n"
"If you think you can keep the pace... then try and bust my face!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "...Ah. Looks like I'm a little short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid ""
"Hey, I'm trying to run a business here! No cash, no contest!\r\n"
"*sigh* Let's take it from the top..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"Go scrounge yourself up some cash and come back later.\r\n"
"I got this spot staked out, so... I'll be waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "All right. Then I'll be back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "Sorry. Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "Wait, what? You chickening out all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid ""
"This ain't no goddamn silent film, buddy. Go scrape up some\r\n"
"cash⑬I dunno, beat up some thugs or something⑬and come\r\n"
"back when you're feeling like a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid ""
"Ugh... Damn... How did I miss, every single time?\r\n"
"I used to box professionally... I should've been wiping\r\n"
"the floor with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid ""
"I don't care what kinda boxer you were. Maybe you got a\r\n"
"nasty punch, but it ain't worth jack shit if you can't make\r\n"
"it hit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid ""
"You gotta think before you act if you wanna land a bruise on\r\n"
"this fresh face! Gotta be four to five steps ahead, minimum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid ""
"You're spoutin' some bullshit, man! This is a street fight, not some "
"goddamn chess game!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid ""
"Hey. I've got a record of 499 to 1, so somebody managed to\r\n"
"do it. In fact, it happened right here in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid "Yeah, I bet you're just making him up in your head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid ""
"Look, I could listen to you yap all day, but I'm running a business here. "
"If you got time to cry, you should be out training instead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "Well, I'll be damned... So you're finally back in town!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "...And you are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1244"
msgid ""
"You gotta be shittin' me! It's ya boy, Mr. Try and Hit Me!\r\n"
"Don't tell me you forgot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid "Yeah... I think I'd remember a name like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid ""
"Well, if it helps jog your memory, I've been challenging\r\n"
"people on the street to hit me for prize money. It ain't\r\n"
"your average desk job, but hey, it's a living!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid ""
"I offer my services for 3,000 yen a minute. Within that,\r\n"
"you're free to try and hit me as much as you like, with a\r\n"
"reward of 50 grand if you're successful. Not bad, I know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid ""
"Ever since you smacked me a good one, oh, some two-odd years\r\n"
"back, I've been training all over Japan, vowing to never get\r\n"
"hit again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid ""
"I've gone up against boxers, Muay Thai experts, you name it.\r\n"
"And now you're finally back... What kept ya so long!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "...A lot of things, actually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid ""
"Well shoot, it feels like I've been waiting forever for this\r\n"
"day! How about challenging the new-and-improved me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid ""
"(All I have to do is hit him once and I'll earn 50,000 yen.\r\n"
"That doesn't sound so hard...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid "All right. I'll take you on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear! It'll cost you 3,000 yen\r\n"
"up front. That okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
msgid "Fine by me... Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid ""
"All right! Punch or kick me in a minute or less, and that\r\n"
"50,000 yen prize money is all yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid ""
"And weapons are off limits⑬gotta keep it clean. Now then...\r\n"
"If you think you can keep the pace... then try and bust my face!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1436"
msgid "...Ah. Looks like I'm a little short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid ""
"Hey, I'm trying to run a business here! No cash, no contest!\r\n"
"*sigh* Let's take it from the top..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid ""
"Go scrounge yourself up 3,000 yen and come back later.\r\n"
"I got this spot staked out, so... I'll be waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1472"
msgid "All right. Then I'll be back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484"
msgid "Sorry... Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid "Wait, what? You chickening out all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1520"
msgid ""
"I spent a ton of time training to dodge those crazy fists of\r\n"
"yours, so you better get your shit together and come back."
msgstr ""

